  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Let the earth bring forth … beast of the earth after his kind, Gen. 1:24. God formed every beast of the field, Gen. 2:19 (Moses 3:19). Of every clean beast thou shalt take, Gen. 7:2. Some evil beast hath devoured him, Gen. 37:20 (37:33). Whosoever lieth with a beast shall … be put to death, Ex. 22:19 (Lev. 20:15; Deut. 27:21). These are the beasts which ye shall eat, Lev. 11:2 (Deut. 14:4). Neither shalt thou lie with any beast, Lev. 18:23. ignorant: I was as a beast before thee, Ps. 73:22. righteous man regardeth the life of his beast, Prov. 12:10. they might see that they themselves are beasts, Eccl. 3:18. man hath no preeminence above a beast, Eccl. 3:19. assemble all the beasts of the field, Jer. 12:9. dwelling shall be with the beasts of the field, Dan. 4:25. four great beasts came up from the sea, Dan. 7:3. Be not afraid, ye beasts of the field, Joel 2:22.",
