    {
      "text": "set him on his own beast, Luke 10:34. Wherein were all manner of fourfooted beasts, Acts 10:12 (11:6). If … I have fought with beasts, 1 Cor. 15:32. Cretians are alway liars, evil beasts, Titus 1:12. every kind of beasts … tamed of mankind, James 3:7. as natural brute beasts, made to be taken and destroyed, 2 Pet. 2:12. what they know naturally, as brute beasts, Jude 1:10. round about the throne, were four beasts, Rev. 4:6. beast … ascendeth out of the bottomless pit, Rev. 11:7 (17:8). beast rise up out of the sea, Rev. 13:1. beast coming up out of the earth, Rev. 13:11. victory over the beast, Rev. 15:2. four beasts fell down and worshipped God, Rev. 19:4. beast was taken, and … the false prophet, Rev. 19:20.",
